<title>USA: AutoBond president resigns.</title>
<headline>AutoBond president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AutoBond Acceptance Corp said Wednesday that President Charley Pond resigned as of Monday.</p>
<p>Pond's duties have been assumed by Chairman and Chief Executive William Winsauer and Chief Operating Officer Adrian Katz.</p>
<p>Katz told Reuters that it was unlikely the company would hire a successor.</p>
<p>AutoBond is a specialty consumer finance company.</p>
</text>
